cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Epione dry-lab modelling: computational design and validation of a multi-cassette proenkephalin therapeutic"
message: "If you use this repository, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - name: "iGEM Patras 2026"
    website: "https://github.com/kei-zan/dry-lab-modelling"
